"amount of Hydrogen and Oxygen.<br><br><b>Defining electric charges</"
"b><br>Use box brackets to specify the electric charge of an element, as "
"shown in this example:<br><i>4H[+] + 2O -> cH2O[2+]</i> (Result: <b>4</b> "
